Package: motanka-archive-keyring
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: signing key and apt pin for the Motanka repository
 Motanka is an Omarchy-compatible Hyprland layer for Ubuntu. This package
 installs the public key that signs the Motanka apt repository, for use
 with Signed-By, and an apt pin. Packages from the Motanka repository get
 priority 500 when their name is motanka or starts with motanka-, and
 priority -1 otherwise, so the repository cannot replace a package that
 Motanka does not own.
